Every clinician is a pain-equity-duty-holder.
Every clinical-practice-organization is a pain-equity-duty-holder.
Every health-system is a pain-equity-duty-holder.
Every payer is a pain-equity-duty-holder.
Every pain-equity-duty-holder should vigilantly monitor a health-inequity.
